  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Heaven Overseeing Tower Lord tells his will to awaken as the Refinement Path Convention reaches its end, because restoring Fate still needs preparations. His will says that besides himself and Heaven Overseeing Tower Lord they still need the power of two rank eights. Three days later he is one of four rank eight Gu Immortals above Hairy Foot Mountain in Central Continent. At the sixth round he cries out and deals the crucial blow that opens Infallible blessed land. He names the place and says the owner is a refinement path great expert who made things difficult for Ren Zu.",
      "chapters": [
        845
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_heaven_overseeing_tower_lord",
        "sys_refinement_path_convention",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "loc_hairy_foot_mountain",
        "reg_central_continent",
        "loc_infallible_blessed_land",
        "char_ren_zu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He is a white haired man with a young appearance.",
      "chapters": [
        845
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He has the appearance of a young man in white clothing.",
      "chapters": [
        871
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "white-clothing",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He is a refinement path great expert. In his opinion an Immortal Gu under repair is beyond saving, and even he could not save it if he tried.",
      "chapters": [
        996
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "refinement-path",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Heaven Overseeing Tower Lord summons him and Bi Chen Tian to reinforce Heavenly Lotus Sect against immortal zombie Bo Qing’s attack, and the three use Heavenly Court’s teleportation Gu formation to arrive at the sect’s base, where a battle of rank eights erupts.",
      "chapters": [
        997
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "heavenly-lotus-sect-reinforcement",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_bi_chen_tian",
        "fac_heavenly_lotus_sect",
        "char_bo_qing",
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "sys_gu_formation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After sword qi damages Heaven Overseeing Tower, Heaven Overseeing Tower Lord looks at Bi Chen Tian and Lian Jiu Sheng as the remaining suspects. Lian Jiu Sheng laughs and says any strict test is already too outdated. He then says Lian Jiu Sheng never existed in the first place, suicides, destroys his immortal aperture, and creates winds of assimilation. He had been there for a thousand years, and nobody had ever suspected him.",
      "chapters": [
        1005
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "exposed-as-traitor",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_heaven_overseeing_tower"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Shadow Sect researched for tens of thousands of years, found an opportunity, and paid a heavy price to send the traitor Lian Jiu Sheng into Heavenly Court. After joining he could not get much intel. He is named among rank eight Gu Immortals who joined Heavenly Court in the last thousands of years.",
      "chapters": [
        1070
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "shadow-sect-insertion",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_shadow_sect"
      ]
    }
  ],
